Value Filldown HOSTNAME (\S+)
Value Filldown UPTIME (.+?)
Value OS_VERSION (\d+\.\d+\([\w.]+\)\w*)
Value MODEL (\S+)
Value SERIAL (\w+)

Start
  ^\S+ uptime is ${UPTIME}
  ^\s+Model number\s*:\s+${MODEL}
  ^\s+Processor board ID\s+${SERIAL}
  ^Cisco IOS Software.*Version\s+${OS_VERSION}
  ^\S+#\s*$$ -> Record
